  "question": "CVS Health wants to identify the top-selling drug for each manufacturer based on total sales amount.\n\nWrite a query to return each manufacturer, their top-selling drug, and the total sales generated by that drug. Order the output alphabetically by manufacturer.",
  "notes": [],
